flowchart TB
  subgraph ingress[Request handling]
    Client[Client] --> Gateway[Gateway]
    Gateway --> Auth{Authorized?}
    Auth -->|yes| API[API service]
    Auth -->|no| Reject[Reject request]
  end

  subgraph processing[Async processing]
    Queue[Work queue] --> Worker[Worker]
    Worker --> Dedupe{Already handled?}
    Dedupe -->|yes| Ack[Acknowledge]
    Dedupe -->|no| Process[Process work]
    Process -->|success| Commit[Commit result]
    Process -->|failure| Retry{Retries left?}
    Retry -->|yes| Queue
  end

  subgraph storage[State and delivery]
    Cache[(Cache)]
    DB[(Database)]
    Outbox[(Outbox)] --> Notify[Notify client]
    DLQ[(Dead-letter queue)]
  end

  API --> Cache
  API --> Queue
  Cache -->|miss| DB
  Dedupe -.-> DB
  Commit --> DB
  Commit --> Outbox
  Retry -->|no| DLQ
  Notify -.-> Client
